<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Industrial seeks suspension.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Industrial seeks suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian property-based Berjaya Industrial Bhd said it has requested a suspension in the trading of its stock &quot;until further notice.&quot;</p>
<p>In a statement sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange late on Monday, the company said it would &quot;shortly forward to the exchange our reasons for this request.&quot; It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>On Monday, shares of the firm ended at 2.99 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
